              "value": "(conjuration, extradimensional, teleportation)\n\nRequirements: A creature within 60 feet of Graem or Grinlowe is in contact with the waters of Stormholt\n\nThe hag casts maze (37) on the creature, magically pulling the creature beneath the water (regardless of its actual depth) into an extradimensional underwater maze of shipwrecks. Between the two of them, Graem and Grinlowe can have only one creature trapped in the maze, but either hag can use the Sustain a Spell action to sustain the effect."
